WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.443 --> 00:00:02.540
- What do you do, dog?

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:03.686
I can't even deal with this.

00:00:03.686 --> 00:00:06.269
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.892 --> 00:00:11.330
Hi, it's Miranda Lambert.

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:14.346
Today, I'm doing an interview
with rescue puppies,

00:00:14.346 --> 00:00:18.513
as you can see, they're all
up for adoption by the way.

00:00:21.435 --> 00:00:23.396
My dogs have chewed a lot
of interesting things.

00:00:23.396 --> 00:00:25.765
The very only Louis
Vuitton purse I ever owned

00:00:25.765 --> 00:00:29.451
was given to me and it lost
its handles really quickly,

00:00:29.451 --> 00:00:31.666
so I gave up on nice things.

00:00:31.666 --> 00:00:35.833
My dogs are more important
than nice things, I realized.

00:00:38.867 --> 00:00:40.889
If I could collaborate
with another artist,

00:00:40.889 --> 00:00:42.378
there's a lot, I think,

00:00:42.378 --> 00:00:44.490
but I'm a huge fan of Beyonce's.

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:48.323
Probably every girl's
answer would be Beyonce.

00:00:49.763 --> 00:00:53.930
My favorite mixed drink is
Tito's Vodka and La Croix.

00:00:59.178 --> 00:01:01.199
I don't have a favorite song or album

00:01:01.199 --> 00:01:03.415
because they're all my
babies, they're like my dogs,

00:01:03.415 --> 00:01:07.115
but I really enjoyed the process
of this last record I did

00:01:07.115 --> 00:01:09.338
called The Weight of These
Wings because I took my time

00:01:09.338 --> 00:01:12.342
on it and spent over
a year writing for it,

00:01:12.342 --> 00:01:15.406
and I really got to sort
of explore my songwriting

00:01:15.406 --> 00:01:18.989
in a different way than
I ever have before.

00:01:21.689 --> 00:01:23.808
I am a huge Audioslave fan.

00:01:23.808 --> 00:01:26.358
I'd say that was pretty different
than the rest of the stuff

00:01:26.358 --> 00:01:28.275
on my iPod, old school.

00:01:34.554 --> 00:01:35.939
My favorite place to eat in Nashville,

00:01:35.939 --> 00:01:37.816
it's actually a bar, it's called Winners.

00:01:37.816 --> 00:01:39.709
So, Winners and Losers,
those are my hang out spots

00:01:39.709 --> 00:01:41.840
in midtown, but they have
delicious chicken tenders

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:43.340
and awesome pizza.

00:01:48.297 --> 00:01:49.813
Well, this inspired me to start it.

00:01:49.813 --> 00:01:53.460
My passion for dogs, and
rescue dogs, and mutts.

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:54.797
If you are not a dog lover yet,

00:01:54.797 --> 00:01:58.319
you should become one, and I
would say adopt, don't shop,

00:01:58.319 --> 00:01:59.583
love a shelter pet.

00:01:59.583 --> 00:02:01.333
What did you do, dog?

